From: Ayushman Chhabra <14110965+ayushmanchhabra@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 19:47:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Use the platform's title for the save file picker

Chrome's "Warning: this site can see edits you make" is meant for
websites, not an app's own save dialog.

Refs: nwjs/nw.js#8336
---
 .../chrome_file_system_access_permission_context.cc             | 2 --
 1 file changed, 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/chrome/browser/file_system_access/chrome_file_system_access_permission_context.cc b/chrome/browser/file_system_access/chrome_file_system_access_permission_context.cc
index 449d83a1..1f4e19a4 100644
--- a/chrome/browser/file_system_access/chrome_file_system_access_permission_context.cc
+++ b/chrome/browser/file_system_access/chrome_file_system_access_permission_context.cc
@@ -2913,8 +2913,6 @@ std::u16string ChromeFileSystemAccessPermissionContext::GetPickerTitle(
       break;
     case blink::mojom::TypeSpecificFilePickerOptionsUnion::Tag::
         kSaveFilePickerOptions:
-      title = l10n_util::GetStringUTF16(
-          IDS_FILE_SYSTEM_ACCESS_CHOOSER_OPEN_SAVE_FILE_TITLE);
       break;
     case blink::mojom::TypeSpecificFilePickerOptionsUnion::Tag::
         kOpenFilePickerOptions:
-- 
